# Item sprites: one per ItemBase, id 100 + ItemBase, drawn once on the shared body anchors
# (bodies.dsl) so each fits any race. The image of a character is its body, its hair and the
# items it actually wears (Character.gear), nothing else. Pixel by pixel:
# digits 0-5 primary P, a-f secondary S, g-l accent A, m-r element core E, s-x rune zone U.

# Sword (ItemBase::Sword) in the front hand, blade down and forward. Pommel, grip, guard and blade lie
# on one 45 degree axis y = x - 1 through HAND_FRONT: the pommel just above-left of the fist, the grip
# under it (fist_front is drawn over it), the guard across the axis at the fist's lower-right edge.
# Sockets at the pommel and the guard, rune strip along the blade.
sprite 100 sword
size 96 96
layer mainhand
